y further extended for a  \nperiod of four years from June 30, 1954,  \nto June 30, 1958.\nD w ig h t D . E is e n h o w e r\nT h e W h it e H o u s e,\nJune 30, 1954.\nIF. R. Doc. 54-5149; F iled, Ju ly 2, 1954;\n8:59 a. m.]\nTITLE 5— AD M IN ISTRA TIVE \nPERSONNEL\nChapter I— Civil Service Commission\nP art 6— Ex c e p t io n s F rom  t h e \nC o m p e t it iv e S ervice\ndepartment  o","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_10541.txt","sha256":"ba0f66a39d8179a88b9cfae3d3fc0c3d9dbe1e044bc76a908cf25902046a6409","source":{"line":795,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"cdb8dc206d0473cda9b2b85047242bac316f3438c340ef6d6708b1494e9cb93b"}}]}
